  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wishful-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4xVp9RM1/wishcraft(2).png\" alt=\"此模組已納入Wishful Recipes中。請點擊此處了解更多。它能自動生成合成配方，因此與其他模組高度相容，且無需繁雜設定。\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bGJxy23.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smelting-cobblestone-in-blast-a-furnace-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/845281?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fsmelting-cobblestone-in-blast-a-furnace-fabricforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/smelting-cobblestone-in-blast-a-furnace-fabricforge?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>這個完全可設定的模組，讓您能將所有石頭方塊在高爐中熔煉，速度是普通熔爐的兩倍。預設情況下，它新增了以下物品的高爐熔煉配方：鵝卵石、石頭、石磚、深板岩碎石、深板岩磚、深板岩瓦、砂岩、紅砂岩、地獄磚、玄武岩、拋光黑石磚、石英方塊以及地獄石。您也可以在設定檔中新增或移除這些配方。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/feFVgxd.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sf89fRO.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EFCLsqg.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zwqoQ5q.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"></p><p><strong>設定</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可以直接在遊戲內設定此模組，或編輯設定檔資料夾中的JSON檔案 <code>config/blastingstone.json</code>。請注意，任何改動都需要重新啟動Minecraft才能生效。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>blasting_list</strong> - 一個字串列表，每個字串代表一個高爐熔煉配方，指定了輸入物品、輸出物品以及熔煉獲得的經驗值</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
